  "keyFeatures": [
    "Interactive code editor with real-time syntax feedback",
    "Guided and unguided lesson modes for step-by-step or self-directed learning",
    "Support for three motor types: NEO (REV), Kraken (CTRE), and CIM (PWMSparkMax)",
    "Built-in code review with line-by-line diagnostics (correct vs. incorrect lines highlighted)",
    "Solution reveal system for learners who get stuck",
    "Lessons covering motor definition, single-motor activation, 2-motor arcade tank drive, and 4-motor arcade tank drive",
    "Controllers lesson for mapping CommandXboxController (driver and operator ports)",
    "Integrated API reference browser with tabs for WPILib, REV, CTRE, and utility classes",
    "Available as both a web app and a desktop Windows executable",
    "No-install web version hosted on GitHub Pages"
  ],
